  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Climate Coalition 2022 to 2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CA&#x2019;s grant will go towards the core costs of TCC&#x2019;s Secretariat in order to enable the Secretariat to organize and coordinate TCC core activities to increase climate action in the UK, particularly Show the Love in Feb 2023 and preparations for Great Big Green Week in Sept 2023 - the Coalition&#x2019;s two major moments for mobilizing member organisations and the public and for engaging politicians. In 2022-23, CA&#x2019;s core grant will also contribute to the development of a new `place-based engagement platform&#x2019; which will enable Christian Aid and other TCC member organisations to access information about climate-related activities and groups in every constituency in the UK (so that Christian Aid churches and supporters can be better connected to local climate initiatives and groups).</narrative>
  </description>
